1
00:00:00,293 --> 00:00:03,123
(Bernadette:)This one is of a woman
giving birth in a river.

2
00:00:03,129 --> 00:00:06,469
(Howard:)Okay, that is
the least Jewish thing

3
00:00:06,466 --> 00:00:08,766
(Howard:)I've ever seen in my life.

4
00:00:11,671 --> 00:00:14,341
(Howard:)You feel like Raj is getting
a little carried away

5
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:15,810
(Howard:)with all the baby stuff?

6
00:00:15,809 --> 00:00:16,979
(Bernadette:)I don't think so.

7
00:00:16,976 --> 00:00:18,676
(Bernadette:)He just wants to be
part of the experience.

8
00:00:18,678 --> 00:00:20,948
(Howard:)All right, if you say so.

9
00:00:20,947 --> 00:00:22,047
(Howard:)What's in the box?

10
00:00:22,048 --> 00:00:23,448
(Bernadette:)Oh, it's an ultrasonic
microphone

11
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:24,820
(Bernadette:)so we can hear
the baby's heartbeat.

12
00:00:24,818 --> 00:00:26,618
(Sheldon:)Oh.

13
00:00:26,619 --> 00:00:27,619
(Howard:)That's cool.

14
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:28,620
(Howard:)Can we try it?

15
00:00:28,621 --> 00:00:30,221
(Bernadette:)Actually, Raj ordered it.

16
00:00:30,223 --> 00:00:33,023
(Bernadette:)He made me promise
to wait till he was here.

17
00:00:33,026 --> 00:00:34,696
(Howard:)So he can be...

18
00:00:34,694 --> 00:00:36,664
(Howard:)part of the experience?

19
00:00:36,663 --> 00:00:37,863
(Bernadette:)Yeah.

20
00:00:37,864 --> 00:00:41,434
(Howard:)I'm surprised he let us conceive
without him.

21
00:00:41,434 --> 00:00:44,334
(Bernadette:)It's a sore spot...
don't bring it up.

22
00:00:47,407 --> 00:00:49,077
(Penny:)It's so cute
and rustic up here.

23
00:00:49,075 --> 00:00:50,305
(Sheldon:)I know.

24
00:00:50,310 --> 00:00:52,340
(Leonard:)Did you see they still have
a video rental place?

25
00:00:52,345 --> 00:00:54,545
(Leonard:)it's like Colonial Williamsburg.

26
00:00:54,547 --> 00:00:56,777
(Sheldon:)Well...

27
00:00:56,783 --> 00:00:59,483
(Sheldon:)cell service is down
to one bar,

